    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u201cA quiet moment beneath the sea, where I meet my own fishy friends.\u201d</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Polarium</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806010/extras/8a3440637fd8c05d147d189ecb8e4f4d.avif?t=1749708915\" width=360 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Relaxing background idle gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cPolarium grows little by little, just by staying by your side.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806010/extras/c9aef5cac011571ac846939c58ae133e.poster.avif?t=1749708915\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806010/extras/c9aef5cac011571ac846939c58ae133e.webm?t=1749708915\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806010/extras/c9aef5cac011571ac846939c58ae133e.mp4?t=1749708915\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even while you leave the window open and focus on other tasks,<br>your fish quietly grow, and pearls slowly accumulate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Like a small aquarium by the window,<br>your ocean friends gently drift across the screen.<br>And when you return,<br>you\u2019ll find joy in the subtle changes beneath the sea.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invite new ocean friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cWho will come next?\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806010/extras/b5f9a06acb70ef6a3676655c151bc879.poster.avif?t=1749708915\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806010/extras/b5f9a06acb70ef6a3676655c151bc879.webm?t=1749708915\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806010/extras/b5f9a06acb70ef6a3676655c151bc879.mp4?t=1749708915\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the depths of the sea, you can invite unique fish through the clam-shaped gate \u2014 each one with a different look every time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Patterns, colors, fins, and even expressions are all randomly generated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more you collect, the more your collection grows, filling your own underwater world with new friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806010/extras/e6b408da1a92d54fa97754383315fcbf.poster.avif?t=1749708915\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806010/extras/e6b408da1a92d54fa97754383315fcbf.webm?t=1749708915\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806010/extras/e6b408da1a92d54fa97754383315fcbf.mp4?t=1749708915\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Share the love</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cThe magic of two lives coming together to create a new one.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806010/extras/8a7021ce39b49bbf1721dc0700357d30.poster.avif?t=1749708915\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806010/extras/8a7021ce39b49bbf1721dc0700357d30.webm?t=1749708915\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806010/extras/8a7021ce39b49bbf1721dc0700357d30.mp4?t=1749708915\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you breed two different fish,<br>you might discover rare or uniquely shaped new ones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The results of each combination are yours to uncover!<br>Enjoy the thrill of collection and the joy of experimentation, all in one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806010/extras/5dcfbcaf4190e3de817577508f33e8dc.poster.avif?t=1749708915\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806010/extras/5dcfbcaf4190e3de817577508f33e8dc.webm?t=1749708915\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806010/extras/5dcfbcaf4190e3de817577508f33e8dc.mp4?t=1749708915\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The ocean keeps growing!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cYour underwater base grows slowly, but surely.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806010/extras/16d5c804a8d47b405c281a049851004f.poster.avif?t=1749708915\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806010/extras/16d5c804a8d47b405c281a049851004f.webm?t=1749708915\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806010/extras/16d5c804a8d47b405c281a049851004f.mp4?t=1749708915\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To collect or breed fish, you\u2019ll need special buildings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade various facilities like your base, the Love Rock, and the Clam Gate to meet more fish \u2014 faster and in greater variety.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more you upgrade, the livelier your underwater world becomes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pearl gifts from your fish</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cLittle treasures gifted by your fish.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806010/extras/f36cbac1af4bea7c8f40474c77f5ae4c.poster.avif?t=1749708915\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806010/extras/f36cbac1af4bea7c8f40474c77f5ae4c.webm?t=1749708915\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806010/extras/f36cbac1af4bea7c8f40474c77f5ae4c.mp4?t=1749708915\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over time, your fish quietly produce pearls.<br>These pearls are a key resource used to upgrade buildings and discover rare fish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather these precious treasures slowly and gently beneath the sea,<br>and grow your own little underwater kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806010/extras/4384e9c9a01a123baab75b5b07dca793.poster.avif?t=1749708915\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806010/extras/4384e9c9a01a123baab75b5b07dca793.webm?t=1749708915\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806010/extras/4384e9c9a01a123baab75b5b07dca793.mp4?t=1749708915\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u201cA quiet moment beneath the sea, where I meet my own fishy friends.\u201d</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Polarium</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806010/extras/8a3440637fd8c05d147d189ecb8e4f4d.avif?t=1749708915\" width=360 height=360 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Relaxing background idle gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cPolarium grows little by little, just by staying by your side.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806010/extras/c9aef5cac011571ac846939c58ae133e.poster.avif?t=1749708915\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806010/extras/c9aef5cac011571ac846939c58ae133e.webm?t=1749708915\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806010/extras/c9aef5cac011571ac846939c58ae133e.mp4?t=1749708915\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Even while you leave the window open and focus on other tasks,<br>your fish quietly grow, and pearls slowly accumulate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Like a small aquarium by the window,<br>your ocean friends gently drift across the screen.<br>And when you return,<br>you\u2019ll find joy in the subtle changes beneath the sea.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Invite new ocean friends!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cWho will come next?\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806010/extras/b5f9a06acb70ef6a3676655c151bc879.poster.avif?t=1749708915\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806010/extras/b5f9a06acb70ef6a3676655c151bc879.webm?t=1749708915\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806010/extras/b5f9a06acb70ef6a3676655c151bc879.mp4?t=1749708915\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In the depths of the sea, you can invite unique fish through the clam-shaped gate \u2014 each one with a different look every time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Patterns, colors, fins, and even expressions are all randomly generated.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more you collect, the more your collection grows, filling your own underwater world with new friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806010/extras/e6b408da1a92d54fa97754383315fcbf.poster.avif?t=1749708915\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806010/extras/e6b408da1a92d54fa97754383315fcbf.webm?t=1749708915\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806010/extras/e6b408da1a92d54fa97754383315fcbf.mp4?t=1749708915\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Share the love</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cThe magic of two lives coming together to create a new one.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806010/extras/8a7021ce39b49bbf1721dc0700357d30.poster.avif?t=1749708915\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806010/extras/8a7021ce39b49bbf1721dc0700357d30.webm?t=1749708915\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806010/extras/8a7021ce39b49bbf1721dc0700357d30.mp4?t=1749708915\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you breed two different fish,<br>you might discover rare or uniquely shaped new ones.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The results of each combination are yours to uncover!<br>Enjoy the thrill of collection and the joy of experimentation, all in one.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806010/extras/5dcfbcaf4190e3de817577508f33e8dc.poster.avif?t=1749708915\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806010/extras/5dcfbcaf4190e3de817577508f33e8dc.webm?t=1749708915\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806010/extras/5dcfbcaf4190e3de817577508f33e8dc.mp4?t=1749708915\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The ocean keeps growing!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cYour underwater base grows slowly, but surely.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806010/extras/16d5c804a8d47b405c281a049851004f.poster.avif?t=1749708915\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806010/extras/16d5c804a8d47b405c281a049851004f.webm?t=1749708915\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806010/extras/16d5c804a8d47b405c281a049851004f.mp4?t=1749708915\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To collect or breed fish, you\u2019ll need special buildings.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade various facilities like your base, the Love Rock, and the Clam Gate to meet more fish \u2014 faster and in greater variety.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more you upgrade, the livelier your underwater world becomes!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pearl gifts from your fish</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u201cLittle treasures gifted by your fish.\u201d</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806010/extras/f36cbac1af4bea7c8f40474c77f5ae4c.poster.avif?t=1749708915\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806010/extras/f36cbac1af4bea7c8f40474c77f5ae4c.webm?t=1749708915\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806010/extras/f36cbac1af4bea7c8f40474c77f5ae4c.mp4?t=1749708915\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over time, your fish quietly produce pearls.<br>These pearls are a key resource used to upgrade buildings and discover rare fish.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather these precious treasures slowly and gently beneath the sea,<br>and grow your own little underwater kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806010/extras/4384e9c9a01a123baab75b5b07dca793.poster.avif?t=1749708915\" width=564 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806010/extras/4384e9c9a01a123baab75b5b07dca793.webm?t=1749708915\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3806010/extras/4384e9c9a01a123baab75b5b07dca793.mp4?t=1749708915\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "short_description": "Polarium is a relaxing idle game set in the serene world of Antarctica. Discover peaceful marine life, learn about polar ecosystems, and find comfort in nature. Inspired by real research, the game blends healing gameplay with subtle messages on climate and biodiversity.",
